# probe (quest rework P7): a quest's onZoneOut (interaction_lookup's zone-wide onZoneOut key, which luautils::OnZoneOut
# runs as the char leaves the zone: CZone::CharZoneOut, on a warp and on a logout alike) through the C# bridge. Elderly
# Pursuits (otherAreas 75; on C# since Other Areas group 5, whose `#zoneout` flow holds these steps): Carpenters'
# Landing's onZoneOut sets Prog 2 back to 1 (Para to be fought again). Accepted at Prog 1 with the Antique Amulet:
# qm_para pops Para (STENCH_OF_DECAY); Para killed: Prog 2; a warp to Southern San d'Oria: onZoneOut, Prog 1. Back, Prog
# 2 (a GM): a logout: onZoneOut, Prog 1. Prog 3 (a GM): section 2's check (Prog <= 2) fails, so a warp keeps Prog 3.
# Prog 1 (a GM): a warp keeps Prog 1 (the handler's Prog 2 test).
# Recorded on the Lua quest (P7); the replay ran a test-only C# copy of the whole quest (removed in Other Areas group 5)
# and now runs the port, ElderlyPursuits.cs. A new record refuses (a probe records Lua only). Not a quest port: the key
# names no quest (Program.IsProbe).
# engine-small-2: re-recorded on C# (`rerecord`, the trace's recorder csharp-rerecord) when the play time
# moved onto the steady clock and every login's 0x00A changed; a Lua record refuses, since Elderly Pursuits on C#
# answers it (a probe records Lua only).
lists CarpentersLanding/onZoneOut/1 CarpentersLanding/qm_para/onTrigger CarpentersLanding/Para/onMobDeath
char zone=CarpentersLanding pos=-414.6,0,-363.5 job=WAR lvl=75
quest OtherAreas.SecretsOfOvensLost completed
quest OtherAreas.ElderlyPursuits accepted
charvar Quest[4][75]Prog 1
keyitem AntiqueAmulet
login
trigger qm_para                         # Prog 1: Para popped (claimed); STENCH_OF_DECAY
kill PARA                               # Prog 2
warp -14.7,2.1,11.8 SouthernSanDoria    # onZoneOut at Prog 2: Prog 1
warp -414.6,0,-363.5 CarpentersLanding
charvar Quest[4][75]Prog 2              # a GM
logout                                  # onZoneOut at Prog 2: Prog 1
login
charvar Quest[4][75]Prog 3              # a GM
warp -14.7,2.1,11.8 SouthernSanDoria    # Prog 3: section 2 off, no onZoneOut: Prog 3 kept
warp -414.6,0,-363.5 CarpentersLanding
charvar Quest[4][75]Prog 1              # a GM
warp -14.7,2.1,11.8 SouthernSanDoria    # onZoneOut at Prog 1: Prog 1 kept
